<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυν-άγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>collect and bring to</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.75.2
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				5.97.3
			</span></i>, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				11
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span> ; <i>gather together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				6.16
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				23.37
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				90.23
			</span></i> (Rosetta, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				3.4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.338
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ -συνηγμένοι ἐν Ξόει Βοιωτοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					2.871
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>) ; <i>to be combined,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐκ τῶν πληθυντικῶν εἰς τὰ ἑνικὰ
					-όμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					24.1
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυναχθέντες τόκοι</span>
			<i>accumulated</i> interest, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.72.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/iv A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				1.46.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυναγόμενος ἀριθμός</span>”
				<i>counted up,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bring in,</i> in a discussion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιττὸν-ειν καὶ ταύτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Acad.Ind.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυμφέρω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				288.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>conclude, infer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλογιζόμενοι τὸν μεταξὺ χρόνον
					ἐπισυνάγουσιν ὅτι..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Hyp.</u>
					5.54
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
